 | 2 vagas\n85,15 m² privativos | 105 m² de área total\nValor anunciado: R$ 1.320.000\n\nConheça pessoalmente a planta, a vista e os detalhes que tornam este apartamento uma escolha especial. Entre em contato para agendar sua visita.\n\nValor e disponibilidade sujeitos a confirmação.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8723b63c-2d58-46ad-8d15-a5f136563a96.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/819d4c46-d175-47a0-8960-4ae09fd2c51e.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/464dfb81-466b-4c65-a418-95fb01bcf21d.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c7c18ce5-3bd2-4654-a7e1-cb605a6cc56f.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/14318546-f87c-4383-9b43-18584424c033.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9a50ae20-e39b-45a9-a94a-2c1776b35c35.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/25ed3e4b-5926-4be1-ac33-a2516de888d4.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5d2f9426-abad-48e2-b646-a5c4288897c0.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6b2e1441-7135-4331-97cb-4167559ab0ab.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4f11","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ab9c08323f062f2201bed3c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/19d71517-b50b-4c19-b144-02ead957a07d.jpeg?_pcv=c31b45063bfd4